<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of June 18.</p>
<p>				  June 18/June 17  June 18/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.06		 7.07</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.02		 5.54</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.20		10.21</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -1.59		49.85</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.86		31.33</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -0.93		31.68</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.09		13.80</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.67		32.24</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.91		38.99</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -0.92		37.48</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.16		23.03</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -1.11		93.56</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,285,883,974,901</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,944,407,905,616</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,007,294,335,931</p>
<p>  International funds			    96,719,689,863</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    237,462,043,491</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
